===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|es}} {{m|la|cervesia}}, variant of {{m|la|cervisia}} (compare {{etyl|ca|-}} {{m|ca|cervesa}}, {{etyl|gl|-}} {{m|gl|cervexa}}, {{etyl|pt|-}} {{m|pt|cerveja}}), perhaps related to {{m|la|cremor||juice, thick [[broth]]}}, but likely from {{etyl|cel-gau|es}} {{m|cel-gau|*kerβ ̃-}}, e-vocalism of {{etyl|cel-pro|es}} {{m|cel-pro|*kormi||beer}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|es}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱr̥h₃m-||soup}}.

